@name     string_slot_load
@alias    <s
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_string_slot_load
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  load string from memory slot into parser buffer
@doc
Loads string from slot (0..15) into the active parser string buffer.
Usage: <s slot
@code
    return skode_exec_lts(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
